        <ns1:description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Nature Communications&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;is an open access, multidisciplinary journal dedicated to publishing high-quality research in all areas of the biological, health, physical, chemical and Earth sciences. Papers published by the journal aim to represent important advances of significance to specialists within each field.&lt;/p&gt;

